---@field sortOrder? google_workspace.sheets_v4.PivotGroupSortOrderEnum|string The order the values in this group should be sorted.
---@field groupRule? google_workspace.sheets_v4.PivotGroupRule The group rule to apply to this row/column group.
---@field dataSourceColumnReference? google_workspace.sheets_v4.DataSourceColumnReference The reference to the data source column this grouping is based on.
---@field valueMetadata? google_workspace.sheets_v4.PivotGroupValueMetadataList Metadata about values in the grouping.

---The count limit on rows or columns in the pivot group.
